Q: scrollPageDown keybinding not working while small find window pane is focused (Ctrl+F) but scrollLineDown does work A: <p>SOLVED</p>
<p>Needed to add findInputFocussed to the when condition of scrollPageDown. That is, this code should work in keybindings.json:</p>
<pre><code>{
    &quot;key&quot;: &quot;pagedown&quot;,
    &quot;command&quot;: &quot;scrollPageDown&quot;,
    &quot;when&quot;: &quot;textInputFocus || findInputFocussed&quot;
}
</code></pre>
<p>the default would normally be</p>
<pre><code>{
    &quot;key&quot;: &quot;alt+pagedown&quot;,
    &quot;command&quot;: &quot;scrollPageDown&quot;,
    &quot;when&quot;: &quot;textInputFocus&quot;
}
</code></pre>
